# dart.px - popcorn swooping drone
# canvas 16x16, 2 frames (fin flicker, loop). Faces DOWN (nose at the bottom).
# round olive hull with a short nose, red eye 2x2 at the front, two thin swept fins trailing
# up-and-out from the hull sides. Frame a: fins swept back (up); frame b: fins swing flat out to the
# sides, so the pair reads as a buzzing flap. Hull, eye and nose identical in both frames.
# light: top-left (left fin and hull top-left lit V/v, right side N/n).
# smallest must-read feature: red eye 2x2.
# anchor: frame centre (8,8).
# timing: 67 ms each (4 ticks), fast buzz.
palette
. transparent
E #ff8a86  red-3
K #0b0d1a  outline shared-dark
N #4f6852  olive-2
R #92203a  red-1
V #b9cfa2  olive-4
e #da3d4f  red-2
m #1b2622  olive-0
n #31443a  olive-1
v #7e9a78  olive-3
ramp olive m n N v V
ramp red R e E
frame a 67
